<title>POLAND: Polish food prices fall 0.1 pct in August 20-30.</title>
<headline>Polish food prices fall 0.1 pct in August 20-30.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-09-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish food prices fell 0.1 percent in August 20-30 after staying flat in the previous 10 days and were 0.1 percent higher than in the July 20-30 period, the Central Statistical Office (GUS) said.  </p>
<p>				    AUG 20-30   AUG 10-20  LAST 30 DAYS</p>
<p>POLISH FOOD PRICES (AVG)     -0.1	   0.0	 0.1   (0.2)</p>
<p> Bread				0.1	   0.2	 0.8   (0.7)</p>
<p> Fruit and vegetables	  -8.2	  -3.5     -16.1 (-13.9)</p>
<p> Meat and meat-products	 1.6	   0.7	 3.8   (3.5)</p>
<p> Dairy products		   0.1	   0.1	 0.3   (0.4)</p>
<p> Eggs				 2.8	   2.7	12.7   (12.1</p>
<p>NOTE: In brackets figures for the previous 30-day period ending on August 20.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
